ver</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div><div data-kid=\"120\" class=\"state-cell\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a data-kid=\"121\" class=\"dl dl--compact\" data-state=\"focus\" aria-label=\"Download CV\" href=\"#download-cv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"122\" class=\"dl__surface\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"123\" class=\"dl__label\">Download CV</span>\n\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"124\" class=\"dl__slot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg data-kid=\"125\" class=\"dl__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n\t<path data-kid=\"126\" d=\"M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z\"></path>\n\t<path data-kid=\"127\" d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path>\n</svg>\n\t\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"128\" class=\"dl__tray\"></span>\n\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"129\" class=\"dl__baseline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p data-kid=\"130\" class=\"state-name\">Focus</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div><div data-kid=\"131\" class=\"state-cell\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a data-kid=\"132\" class=\"dl dl--compact\" data-state=\"active\" aria-label=\"Download CV\" href=\"#download-cv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"133\" class=\"dl__surface\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"134\" class=\"dl__label\">Download CV</span>\n\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"135\" class=\"dl__slot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg data-kid=\"136\" class=\"dl__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n\t<path data-kid=\"137\" d=\"M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z\"></path>\n\t<path data-kid=\"138\" d=\"M14 2v6h6\"></path>\n</svg>\n\t\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"139\" class=\"dl__tray\"></span>\n\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t<span data-kid=\"140\" class=\"dl__baseline\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p data-kid=\"141\" class=\"state-name\">Pressed</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>